1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,867
Rule says the gate stays shut after
seven.

2
00:00:03,567 --> 00:00:05,100
I wrote that rule. Open it.

3
00:00:05,967 --> 00:00:08,067
Keep the lamp burning. She's following
it.

4
00:00:08,767 --> 00:00:11,967
Ollie doesn't answer. He just looks
up. You look up too.

5
00:00:12,667 --> 00:00:14,633
Over the gate, the lamp is black.

6
00:00:15,333 --> 00:00:18,467
Wind blew it out at six o'clock.
Before she ever called.

7
00:00:19,167 --> 00:00:20,533
But she said she could see it.

8
00:00:21,567 --> 00:00:24,400
Mia is walking toward a light. And it
isn't yours.
